abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and artifacts for a computational measurement framework
  decomposing representation deficits into nomination, seat quality, and vote
  conversion stages. The party-normalized residual is treated as an observable
  proxy for measured electoral contribution, not as a uniquely identified latent
  capability construct.
